Package: fplida.info
Title: What PLIDA and BLADE Contain
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Will", "Mackey", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "will.mackey@anu.edu.au")
Description: Everything the fplida registry knows about Australia's Person
    Level Integrated Data Asset (PLIDA) and Business Longitudinal Analysis
    Data Environment (BLADE): what the datasets are, what every variable
    means, what values it can take, and where that was published. Someone
    planning a project can ask whether PLIDA carries the column they need
    without installing a Rust toolchain or generating any data. The package
    contains public metadata only. It contains no confidential PLIDA or
    BLADE data. The structural metadata is based on data item lists
    published by the Australian Bureau of Statistics.
